e wasn't 102 hunters but there  were  many right well don't smoke crack  the breaking point came when their then  18 year old daughter finnegan called  kathleen and said we found his phone  and on it texts proving hunter was  having an affair with beau's widow  hallie biden  when i found out he was having an affair  with  our sister-in-law  at that point  i had been losing my mind for the last  year and a half trying to make sense of  what was going on and  in a strange way it was like  finally  i don't i don't love him anymore  did you ever talk to your sister-in-law  after this  once you found out  you know  divorce  is not just  the couple it's not just the kids no no  it's the whole family  we were  very very close all of us yeah  and it was  painful for a long time  buell wouldn't answer that question and  never used her sister-in-law's name in  our interview  you talk about finances and how you  largely left that  to uh to hunter  how much did you know about what  the financial situation was  i  had my head pretty  deeply buried in the sand  the u.s attorney's office in delaware  opened an investigation into hunters  taxes and business dealings in 2018  a subpoena obtained by cbs news  revealed requests for bank records  dating back to 2014  when hunter and kathleen were still  married have you been subpoenaed in this  investigation  even if i was subpoenaed  i kept my head  so deeply buried in the sand  i honestly have nothing  to contribute  have you been subpoenaed though  i have not been subpoenaed  i've talked to  certain investigators but i've not been  subpoenaed i mean i i guess i i haven't  been subpoenaed to to appear before the  grand jury right but i was questioned  because obviously  i was married to him for 24 years were  you at all concerned you could get drawn  into this no  i  barely understood what he did  and i  say that with  embarrassment one of the things an  addict is supposed to do in recovery is  make amends to the people  he's harmed 