  kids doing i think the kids are doing  really well and she regrets that she  wasn't more honest with them she kept a  lot of this secret like most parents do  like a lot of people do and she thinks  the kids could have handled it and and  that she she wishes she was more honest  with them along the way  powerful interviewing great questions  along the way anthony thank you so much
 

